WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.666
After a storm, roofers are flooded with calls, then lose half of them in the follow-up. Here is the software our growth service runs for a roofing business, problem by problem.

00:00:11.566 --> 00:00:17.394
After a storm, inquiries pour in from everywhere, and the ones on a notepad in the truck are gone by Friday.

00:00:18.994 --> 00:00:25.763
In Protected Central every inquiry lands in one ledger, with its source and its stage, kept from first contact to payment.

00:00:27.863 --> 00:00:32.884
Homeowners call three roofers, and the first to answer gets the inspection. Your crew is on a roof.

00:00:34.484 --> 00:00:40.556
Speed to Lead answers each web inquiry from your mailbox within minutes, and puts a call-back on today’s list.

00:00:42.656 --> 00:00:47.451
An inspection is booked, the homeowner forgets, and the crew drives across town for nothing.

00:00:49.051 --> 00:00:54.694
Inspections and adjuster meetings sit on one week grid, and every booking is confirmed and reminded the day before.

00:01:03.051 --> 00:01:08.705
Estimates wait for a decision, insurance jobs wait for an adjuster, and nobody sees which are stuck.

00:01:10.305 --> 00:01:18.502
A roofing pipeline keeps insurance claims in their own stage, with days in stage on every card, and follow-up starts the moment an estimate goes out.

00:01:24.305 --> 00:01:30.737
Deposits, insurer payments and invoices arrive at different times, and nobody knows which jobs actually paid.

00:01:32.337 --> 00:01:39.477
Open any job and see every step and every payment, including the insurer’s, dated and signed, and counted only once you confirm it.

00:01:46.337 --> 00:01:51.062
A review request sent to an unhappy homeowner is how a one-star review gets written.

00:01:52.662 --> 00:02:01.289
Review Request asks once the job is signed off, and Unhappy Customer Recovery puts anyone unhappy in front of a person, with a task to call them today.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:13.611
Every inquiry captured, every inspection confirmed, every estimate and insurance claim moving, and every job tracked to the payment. Book a roofing growth consultation at protectedcentral.com/roofing.
